#: classes/class-admin-assets.php:69 classes/class-admin-page.php:74
msgid "Logs"
msgstr "Dnevniki"

#: classes/class-admin-assets.php:70 classes/class-admin-page.php:739
msgid "Currently there are no logs available."
msgstr "Trenutno ni na voljo nobenih dnevnikov."

#: classes/class-admin-assets.php:71
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all logs? This action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Ali ste prepričani, da želite izbrisati vse dnevnike? Tega dejanja ni mogoče "
"razveljaviti."

#: classes/class-admin-assets.php:72
msgid "Error:"
msgstr "Napaka:"

#: classes/class-admin-assets.php:73
msgid "No lists found for board_id:"
msgstr "Za board_id ni bilo najdenih seznamov:"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:42 classes/class-admin-help.php:106
msgid "Setup guidance"
msgstr "Navodila za nastavitev"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:43
msgid "Placeholders"
msgstr "Oznake"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:108
msgid ""
"Follow these steps to connect WooCommerce to Trello and start creating cards "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Sledite tem korakom, da povežete WooCommerce s Trello in začnete samodejno "
"ustvarjati kartice."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:110
msgid "Set up Trello OAuth 2.0"
msgstr "Nastavite Trello OAuth 2.0"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:112
#, php-format
msgid "Open the %s to create or configure your Trello app."
msgstr "Odprite %s, da ustvarite ali konfigurirate svojo aplikacijo Trello."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:112
msgid "Trello apps administration page"
msgstr "Stran za upravljanje aplikacij Trello"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:115
msgid "Log in to your Trello account."
msgstr "Prijavite se v svoj račun Trello."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:116
msgid ""
"Create or select your Trello app, open its OAuth 2.0 settings, and choose "
"the confidential client type."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarite ali izberite svojo aplikacijo Trello, odprite nastavitve OAuth 2.0 "
"in izberite vrsto zaupnega odjemalca."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:117
msgid ""
"Add the exact OAuth callback URL shown in the plugin settings and enable the "
"read:member:trello, read:board:trello, and write:board:trello scopes."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte natančen URL povratnega klica OAuth, prikazan v nastavitvah "
"vtičnika, in omogočite obsege read:member:trello, read:board:trello in "
"write:board:trello."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:118
msgid ""
"Copy the OAuth client ID and client secret into the plugin settings. Save "
"the settings before connecting."
msgstr ""
"Kopirajte OAuth ID odjemalca in skrivnost odjemalca v nastavitve vtičnika. "
"Shranite nastavitve pred povezovanjem."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:121
msgid ""
"Keep the OAuth client secret private. The plugin requests offline access so "
"it can refresh its short-lived access token automatically."
msgstr ""
"Skrivnost odjemalca OAuth hranite zasebno. Vtičnik zahteva dostop brez "
"povezave, da lahko samodejno osveži svoj kratkotrajni dostopni žeton."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:124
#, php-format
msgid "Open the %s tab and enter your OAuth client ID and client secret."
msgstr ""
"Odprite zavihek %s in vnesite svoj OAuth ID odjemalca ter skrivnost "
"odjemalca."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:124
msgid "Settings → Trello OAuth 2.0"
msgstr "Nastavitve → Trello OAuth 2.0"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:125
msgid ""
"Click Connect Trello account and approve access. The plugin will verify the "
"connection and refresh tokens automatically."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite »Poveži račun Trello« in odobrite dostop. Vtičnik bo preveril "
"povezavo in samodejno osvežil žetone."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:126
#, php-format
msgid "Open the %s tab and select a WooCommerce order status."
msgstr "Odprite zavihek %s in izberite status naročila WooCommerce."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:126 classes/class-admin-page.php:104
msgid "Cards"
msgstr "Kartice"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:127
msgid ""
"For that status, select the Trello board and list where cards should be "
"created, configure the card fields, and enable card creation for the status."
msgstr ""
"Za ta status izberite ploščo in seznam Trello, kjer naj se kartice "
"ustvarijo, konfigurirajte polja kartice in omogočite ustvarjanje kartic za "
"ta status."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:128
msgid ""
"Save the settings, then create or update a test order so it reaches the "
"enabled status. Check the order notes and Trello list to confirm the card "
"was created."
msgstr ""
"Shranite nastavitve, nato ustvarite ali posodobite testno naročilo, da "
"doseže omogočeni status. Preverite opombe naročila in seznam Trello, da "
"potrdite, da je bila kartica ustvarjena."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:131
msgid "Important:"
msgstr "Pomembno:"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:131
msgid ""
"Card settings are configured independently for each WooCommerce order "
"status. Enabling cards for one status does not enable them for the other "
"statuses."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitve kartic se konfigurirajo neodvisno za vsak status naročila "
"WooCommerce. Omogočanje kartic za en status jih ne omogoči za druge statuse."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:133
msgid "If a card is not created"
msgstr "Če kartica ni ustvarjena"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:136
msgid ""
"Check that the status reached by the order is enabled in the Cards tab and "
"has a board and list selected. If no complete board/list destination is "
"selected, the Logs tab records that card creation was skipped."
msgstr ""
"Preverite, da je status, ki ga je naročilo doseglo, omogočen v zavihku "
"Kartice in da sta izbrana plošča ter seznam. Če ni izbran popoln cilj plošče/"
"seznama, zavihek Dnevniki zabeleži, da je bilo ustvarjanje kartice "
"preskočeno."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:137
msgid ""
"Review the Status → Logs tab for the failed request. If authorization has "
"expired or been revoked, reconnect the Trello account in the settings."
msgstr ""
"Preverite zavihek Status → Dnevniki za neuspelo zahtevo. Če je pooblastilo "
"poteklo ali bilo preklicano, v nastavitvah ponovno povežite račun Trello."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:138
msgid ""
"If the previous attempt failed, open the order and use Retry failed card "
"creation after correcting the configuration."
msgstr ""
"Če prejšnji poskus ni uspel, odprite naročilo in po popravku konfiguracije "
"uporabite »Poskusi znova neuspešno ustvarjanje kartice«."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:155
msgid "The WooCommerce order ID number"
msgstr "Številka ID naročila WooCommerce"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:156
msgid "The current order status (e.g., pending, processing, completed)"
msgstr "Trenutni status naročila (npr. v čakanju, v obdelavi, dokončano)"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:157
msgid "Customer's full name (first name + last name)"
msgstr "Polno ime stranke (ime + priimek)"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:158
msgid "Customer's first name"
msgstr "Ime stranke"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:159
msgid "Customer's last name"
msgstr "Priimek stranke"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:160
msgid "Customer's company name"
msgstr "Ime podjetja stranke"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:161
msgid "Customer's email address"
msgstr "E-poštni naslov stranke"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:162
msgid "The date and time the order was created"
msgstr "Datum in čas, ko je bilo naročilo ustvarjeno"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:163
msgid "The total order amount with currency symbol"
msgstr "Skupni znesek naročila s simbolom valute"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:168
msgid "Using Placeholders in Card Names and Descriptions"
msgstr "Uporaba oznak v imenih in opisih kartic"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:170
msgid ""
"You can use dynamic placeholders in the Card Name and Card Description "
"fields that will be automatically replaced with actual customer and order "
"data. This allows you to create personalized Trello cards without having to "
"manually enter information."
msgstr ""
"V poljih Ime kartice in Opis kartice lahko uporabite dinamične oznake, ki "
"bodo samodejno zamenjane z dejanskimi podatki o stranki in naročilu. To vam "
"omogoča ustvarjanje prilagojenih kartic Trello, ne da bi morali ročno "
"vnašati informacije."

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:172
msgid "Available Placeholders"
msgstr "Razpoložljive oznake"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:174
msgid "The following placeholders are available for use:"
msgstr "Na voljo so naslednje oznake:"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:179
msgid "Placeholder"
msgstr "Oznaka"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:180 classes/class-core-fields.php:114
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:193
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Primeri"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:195
msgid "Here are some examples of how to use placeholders:"
msgstr "Tukaj je nekaj primerov uporabe oznak:"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:198 classes/class-admin-help.php:199
msgid "Card Name:"
msgstr "Ime kartice:"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:200 classes/class-admin-help.php:201
msgid "Card Description:"
msgstr "Opis kartice:"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:204
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "Nasveti"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:207
msgid ""
"Placeholders are case-sensitive - always use uppercase placeholders like "
"[ORDER_ID], not [order_id]"
msgstr ""
"Oznake so občutljive na velikost črk – vedno uporabljajte velike črke, npr. "
"[ORDER_ID], ne [order_id]"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:208
msgid ""
"If a field has no data (e.g., company name is empty), the placeholder will "
"show as empty"
msgstr ""
"Če polje nima podatkov (npr. ime podjetja je prazno), bo oznaka prikazana "
"kot prazna"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:209
msgid "You can use multiple placeholders in a single field"
msgstr "V enem polju lahko uporabite več oznak"

#: classes/class-admin-help.php:210
msgid "Placeholders work in both Card Name and Card Description fields"
msgstr "Oznake delujejo tako v polju Ime kartice kot v polju Opis kartice"

