#: classes/class-admin-page.php:555
msgid ""
"Connect a Trello account before choosing boards and lists for your order "
"statuses."
msgstr ""
"Pred izbiro plošč in seznamov za statuse naročil povežite račun Trello."

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:556
msgid "Open Trello settings"
msgstr "Odpri nastavitve Trello"

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:563
msgid ""
"These settings are applied per WooCommerce order status. Choose the Trello "
"board and list for each status, then enable card creation only for the order "
"statuses that should send cards to Trello."
msgstr ""
"Te nastavitve se uporabljajo za vsak status naročila WooCommerce. Za vsak "
"status izberite ploščo in seznam Trello, nato omogočite ustvarjanje kartic "
"le za tiste statuse naročil, ki naj pošiljajo kartice v Trello."

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:573
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Board and List destinations"
msgid "Need more destinations?"
msgstr "Cilji plošče in seznama"

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:574
msgid ""
"Upgrade to LTW Order-to-Board Sync Pro to send cards for each order status "
"to multiple Trello boards and lists, and to use custom order statuses "
"registered by extensions or custom code."
msgstr ""
"Preklopite na LTW Order-to-Board Sync Pro za pošiljanje kartic za vsak "
"status naročila na več plošč in seznamov Trello ter za uporabo statusov "
"naročil po meri, ki jih registrirajo razširitve ali koda po meri."

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:576
msgid "Explore Pro"
msgstr "Raziščite Pro"

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:592
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Settings for %s orders only. When this status is reached, the plugin can "
"create a Trello card using the board and list configured below."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitve samo za naročila s statusom %s. Ko je ta status dosežen, lahko "
"vtičnik ustvari kartico Trello z uporabo spodaj konfigurirane plošče in "
"seznama."

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:704
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Začetek"

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:707
msgid "Connect your store to Trello"
msgstr "Povežite svojo trgovino s Trello"

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:708
msgid ""
"You're almost ready to start creating Trello cards from WooCommerce orders."
msgstr ""
"Skoraj ste pripravljeni začeti ustvarjati kartice Trello iz naročil "
"WooCommerce."

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:710
msgid "Create a confidential OAuth 2.0 client in your Trello app settings."
msgstr ""
"V nastavitvah aplikacije Trello ustvarite zaupnega odjemalca OAuth 2.0."

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:711
msgid "Save the client ID and secret in the Trello OAuth 2.0 settings."
msgstr "Shranite ID odjemalca in skrivnost v nastavitvah Trello OAuth 2.0."

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:712
msgid "Connect your Trello account and approve the requested access."
msgstr "Povežite svoj račun Trello in odobrite zahtevani dostop."

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:715
msgid "Start setup"
msgstr "Začni nastavitev"

#: classes/class-admin-page.php:716
msgid ""
"OAuth tokens are used only to communicate with Trello and are never added to "
"cards or logs."
msgstr ""
"Žetoni OAuth se uporabljajo le za komunikacijo s Trello in se nikoli ne "
"dodajo na kartice ali v dnevnike."

